### ========= Check protected route tests =========

### Register the user
POST https://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "login.test@email.com", "password": "QwertyTest123!" }

### Log the user in to get token
# @name login
POST https://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "login.test@email.com", "password": "QwertyTest123!" }

### Get current user = should be 200
GET https://localhost:5000/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### No token - should be 401
GET https://localhost:5000/api/users/me

### Wtong token - should be 401
GET https://localhost:5000/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer very.much.fake.token

### Create a gig as the freelancer - should be 201
POST {{base}}/gigs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerLogin.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Logo design",
  "category": "design",
  "description": "A logo or something idk",
  "tiers": [
    { "title": "Basic", "priceCents": 50000 },
    { "title": "Premium", "description": "Three concepts", "priceCents": 120000 }
  ]
}

### List freelancer's gigs - should be 200
GET {{base}}/gigs/mygigs
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerLogin.response.body.token}}